-- NUMBER GLUED TO LETTERS -------------------------------------- main.kl  K0127

`3ala` starts with a digit, so I read it as a number, but it has letters in it. Names can't start with a digit in any skin.

9│     let n = 3ala
               ^^^^

Help: Start the name with a letter, or put a space between the number and the word. When the word is a misspelled keyword, which happens often in Franco, I suggest the right spelling.

Learn more: kalam explain K0127
